    {
      "source": "For additional features such as concurrency limiting or task decoration,\nconsider using <a href=\"SimpleAsyncTaskExecutor.html#setVirtualThreads(boolean)\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskExecutor.setVirtualThreads(boolean)</code></a> instead.",
      "translation": "对于并发限制或任务装饰等额外功能，请考虑使用<a href=\"SimpleAsyncTaskExecutor.html#setVirtualThreads(boolean)\"><code>SimpleAsyncTaskExecutor.setVirtualThreads(boolean)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"TaskExecutor.html#execute(java.lang.Runnable)\">TaskExecutor</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"TaskExecutor.html#execute(java.lang.Runnable)\">TaskExecutor</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the underlying virtual <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ThreadFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ThreadFactory</code></a>.\nCan also be used for custom thread creation elsewhere.",
      "translation": "返回底层的虚拟 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ThreadFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ThreadFactory</code></a>。也可用于在其他地方创建自定义线程。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>VirtualThreadTaskExecutor</code> without thread naming.",
      "translation": "创建一个不带线程命名的新<code>VirtualThreadTaskExecutor</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>VirtualThreadTaskExecutor</code> with thread names based\non the given thread name prefix followed by a counter (for example, \"test-0\").",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 `<code>VirtualThreadTaskExecutor</code>`，其线程名称基于给定的前缀后跟一个计数器（例如，\"test-0\"）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>threadNamePrefix</code> - the prefix for thread names (for example, \"test-\")",
      "translation": "<code>threadNamePrefix</code> - 线程名称的前缀（例如，\"test-\"）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The call might return immediately if the implementation uses\nan asynchronous execution strategy, or might block in the case\nof synchronous execution.",
      "translation": "如果实现采用异步执行策略，该调用可能会立即返回；而在同步执行的情况下，它可能会阻塞。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the underlying virtual <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ThreadFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ThreadFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回底层的虚拟 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ThreadFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ThreadFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute the given <code>task</code>.",
      "translation": "执行给定的<code>task</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
